{"title": "Multiattack: Prone (Hook Horror)", "pageid": 14253, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Multiattack:_Prone_(Hook_Horror)", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">For the attack action, see <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Hook_Horror)\" title=\"Multiattack (Hook Horror)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Multiattack_Hook_Horror_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Hook_Horror_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Multiattack_Hook_Horror_Icon.webp/38px-Multiattack_Hook_Horror_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Multiattack_Hook_Horror_Icon.webp/50px-Multiattack_Hook_Horror_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Multiattack (Hook Horror)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Multiattack_Hook_Horror_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Hook_Horror_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/Multiattack_Hook_Horror_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Hook_Horror)\" title=\"Multiattack (Hook Horror)\">Multiattack (Hook Horror)</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Multiattack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp/300px-Generic_Multiattack.webp, /w/images/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp/300px-Generic_Multiattack.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Multiattack: Prone</b> is a passive feature that allows a <a href=\"/wiki/Hook_Horror\" title=\"Hook Horror\">Hook Horror</a> to make two attacks against a prone target with a single action.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The hook horror can make a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Hook_Horror)\" title=\"Multiattack (Hook Horror)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Multiattack_Hook_Horror_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Hook_Horror_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Multiattack_Hook_Horror_Icon.webp/38px-Multiattack_Hook_Horror_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Multiattack_Hook_Horror_Icon.webp/50px-Multiattack_Hook_Horror_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Multiattack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Multiattack_Hook_Horror_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Hook_Horror_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/Multiattack_Hook_Horror_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Hook_Horror)\" title=\"Multiattack (Hook Horror)\">Multiattack</a> if the target is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Hook_Horror\" title=\"Hook Horror\">Hook Horror</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hook_Horror_Spore_Servant\" title=\"Hook Horror Spore Servant\">Hook Horror Spore Servant</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Can <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Hook_Horror)\" title=\"Multiattack (Hook Horror)\">multiattack</a> targets that are <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">prone</a>.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715154242\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1154/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7705/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3588/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 244/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 639925/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.649      1 -total\n 73.55%   28.427      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 31.75%   12.271      3 Template:Icon_link\n 30.56%   11.811      3 Template:Icon_text\n 30.00%   11.595      2 Template:SAI\n 26.35%   10.183      1 Template:Hatnote\n 25.63%  